  "notes": "USAGE: {変化|へんか} is a general word for change and can be used in many contexts.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {変化|へんか}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to change)\n- {変化|へんか}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{起|お}きる→起きる：00521_okiru⟧ (change occurs)\n- {変化|へんか}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{遂|と}げる→遂げる：14323_togeru⟧ (to undergo change)\n- ⟦{大|おお}きな→大きな：02849_ookina⟧/⟦{小|ちい}さな→小さな：02913_chiisana⟧{変化|へんか} (big/small change)\n- {変化|へんか}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{富|と}む→富む：12343_tomu⟧ (rich in variety)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{変更|へんこう}→変更：03616_henkou⟧ - change, modification (deliberate alteration)\n- ⟦{変動|へんどう}→変動：09936_hendou⟧ - fluctuation (repeated changes)\n- ⟦{変容|へんよう}→変容：12115_henyou⟧ - transformation (fundamental change)",
